# [LAKE](../wg/lake.html)

## Summary

The Lightweight Authenticated Key Exchange (LAKE) Working Group met at IETF 127. The session covered working group document status updates, reports from an informal side meeting on extension compatibility, progress on post-quantum key exchange and authentication drafts, formal verification results, and several individual proposals. Key decisions included submitting `draft-ietf-lake-edhoc-psk` to the IESG for publication, forming a design team to address message extension compatibility, and keeping post-quantum hybridization work separate from `draft-ietf-lake-pqsuites` to avoid delaying core cipher suite publication.

