## Decisions and Action Items

1. **`draft-ietf-lake-edhoc-psk`:** Approved to be submitted to the IESG for publication following final shepherd write-up by Marco Tiloca.
2. **Design Team Formation:** Form a Design Team to address extension compatibility across LAKE message flows and authentication methods (participants interested in joining should contact the chairs).
3. **Hybrid Post-Quantum Strategy:** Keep hybrid post-quantum cipher suite work in a separate document dependent on CFRG/COSE algorithm definitions to avoid delaying `draft-ietf-lake-pqsuites`.
4. **`draft-chen-lake-edhoc-aka`:** Participants requested to review the draft and discuss on the mailing list before any adoption call.

